<!-- better app -->

sort the given preorder 

use mid , start , end approach of binary search 

use mid to make it root
mid -> left - range goes from start to mid -1
mid -> right - range goes from mid + 1 to end 

do the above operation recursively

tc - nlogn (sorting) + n (constructing bst) = nlogn
sc - logn(stack used internally for sorting) + logn (recursion stack for creating bst) = logn



